        "description": "Most business dashboards create more reporting, not better decisions.\n\nIn this video, Hayden Miyamoto shows how to replace dashboard overload with one clear, AI-built scorecard that tells your leadership team what is off track, what needs attention, and what gets fixed next.\n\n*You’ll learn:*\n• Which metrics belong on a small-business scorecard\n• How to organize metrics around the customer lifecycle\n• How the green, yellow, and red stoplight system works\n• How to build the first version using AI\n• How to run a focused weekly scorecard review\n\n*GET THE AI SCORECARD PROMPTS:*\nhttps://community.empowerlabs.ai/join?invitation_token=f618616a09ca533f4c5457fb0f922e7935adc13e-93fdb8d8-0742-437f-a65e-c24b9174bb85\n\n*CHAPTERS:*\n0:00 Why business dashboards fail\n0:40 Trackers vs. real scorecards\n1:15 The one-scorecard rule\n1:28 Track the customer lifecycle\n2:16 The stoplight model\n2:38 Build your scorecard with AI\n3:46 Put it into action\n\n#AIForBusiness #BusinessDashboard #SmallBusiness",
